# E-Books and New Library Service Models: An Analysis of the Impact of E-Book Technology on Academic Libraries.

**Authors:** Jantz, Ronald

## Abstract
Analyzes the implications of electronic book technology (e-books) on academic libraries. Discusses new business models for publishers, including self-publishing, Internet publishing, and partnerships with libraries as publishers; impact on library services, including cataloging, circulation, and digital preservation; user benefits; standards; digital rights management; and distributed networking. (Author/LRW)

**Source:** https://eric.ed.gov/?id=EJ635402

